{"info": {"address1": "S-22, Technocrat Industrial Estate", "address2": "2 & 3rd Floor Balanagar", "city": "Hyderabad", "zip": "500037", "country": "India", "phone": "91 40 4698 9999", "fax": "91 40 3912 0023", "website": "https://olectra.com", "industry": "Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery", "industryKey": "farm-heavy-construction-machinery", "industryDisp": "Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Olectra Greentech Limited manufactures and sells electric buses and trucks in India. It operates in two segments, Composite Polymer Insulators and E-Vehicle. The company offers electric tippers. It also provides 1200KV, 330-420KV, 220-245KV, 110-132KV, 52-77KV, 33-36KV, 22-28KV, and 10-15KV composite polymer insulators for transmission and distribution; and tonne, bracket tube, and stay arm insulators for railways. It serves state and central government bodies, and power generation and distribution corporations; private power generation companies; and multinational infrastructure companies. The company was formerly known as Goldstone Infratech Limited and changed its name to Olectra Greentech Limited in July 2018. Olectra Greentech Limited was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 801, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mahesh Babu Subramanian", "title": "MD & Director", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. B. Sharat Chandra", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2020, "totalPay": 6985000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. B. Kiran Kumar Reddy", "title": "General Manager of Technical", "fiscalYear": 2020, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Paritala Hanuman Prasad", "title": "VP of Legal, Company Secretary, Head of Legal & Chief Investor Relations Officer", "fiscalYear": 2020, "totalPay":